12:After a long period of working closely with the relevant authorities, we have made the difficult decision to pause wedding enquiries and bookings at Colliston Farm for the time being.
13-
21:The good news is that we’re not giving up. We remain committed to the approval process and are hopeful that, once the necessary approvals are in place, we’ll be able to welcome couples back and start taking bookings again.
22-
47:Colliston Farm is more than just a wedding venue; it’s a labour of love. For Jamie and Kylie, it’s about creating a space where couples can celebrate their story in their own unique way. Whether it’s saying “I do” under the towering pines, celebrating in the Barn and capturing those golden-hour photos by the creek, the farm offers couples the freedom to craft a wedding that feels like them.
