106:Colliston Farm is available for **weddings, elopements, micro-weddings, celebrations and styled shoots**. We’re a venue hire-only space — you bring your own creative vision and we’ll provide the backdrop.  So, bring your florals, signage, props, you name it!  Just no nails, staples, confetti or glitter, please.
