108-Yes! You can bring your own food trucks, grazing tables, caterers, drinks and alcohol (with RSA-qualified staff serving). This gives you the freedom to tailor your celebration exactly how you want.
113:- **Choice of ceremony settings** – Pine Point, The Milking Shed, or Creekside
